      "numbers": [
        13,
        14,
        15
      ],
      "devanagari": "सुप्राज्य फल मूलानि पुष्पितानि वनानि च |\nप्रशस्त मृग यूथानि शान्त पक्षि गणानि च\nफुल्ल पंकज खण्डानि प्रसन्न सलिलानि च |\nकारण्डव विकीर्णानि तटाकानि सरांसि च\nद्रक्ष्यसे दृष्टि रंयाणि गिरि प्रस्रवणानि च |\nरमणीयानि अरण्यानि मयूर अभिरुतानि च",
      "iast": "suprājya phala mūlāni puṣpitāni vanāni ca |\npraśasta mṛga yūthāni śānta pakṣi gaṇāni ca\nphulla paṅkaja khaṇḍāni prasanna salilāni ca |\nkāraṇḍava vikīrṇāni taṭākāni sarāṃsi ca\ndrakṣyase dṛṣṭi raṃyāṇi giri prasravaṇāni ca |\nramaṇīyāni araṇyāni mayūra abhirutāni ca",
      "translation": "\"See the well-flowered woodlands with well-grown fruits and tubers, with herds of best animals and peaceful bird flocks... tranquil waters with spreading clusters of bloomed lotuses and water-birds in the pools and lakes... eye-pleasing rapids from mountains and you can see pleasant forests loaded with the hearty screams of precooks...",
