    {
      "id": "3.8.18",
      "label": "3.8.18",
      "numbers": [
        18
      ],
      "devanagari": "ततः शुभतरे तूणी धनुषी च आयतेक्षणा |\nददौ सीता तयोः भ्रात्रोः खड्गौ च विमलौ ततः",
      "iast": "tataḥ śubhatare tūṇī dhanuṣī ca āyatekṣaṇā |\ndadau sītā tayoḥ bhrātroḥ khaḍgau ca vimalau tataḥ",
      "translation": "Then the broad eyed Seetha gave auspicious quivers and bows to those brothers and then spotless swords too.",
