    {
      "id": "3.8.19",
      "label": "3.8.19",
      "numbers": [
        19
      ],
      "devanagari": "आबध्य च शुभे तूणी चापे च आदाय सस्वने |\nनिष्क्रान्तौ आश्रमात् गन्तुम् उभौ तौ राम लक्ष्मणौ",
      "iast": "ābadhya ca śubhe tūṇī cāpe ca ādāya sasvane |\nniṣkrāntau āśramāt gantum ubhau tau rāma lakṣmaṇau",
      "translation": "Both of those two Rama and Lakshmana tied their beautiful quivers well on their backs, and took the twangy bows and exited from that hermitage to go on their way.",
