      "id": "3.8.20",
      "label": "3.8.20",
      "numbers": [
        20
      ],
      "devanagari": "शीघ्रम् तौ रूपसंपन्नौ अनुज्ञातौ महर्षिणा |\nप्रस्थितौ धृत चापा असी सीतया सह राघवौ",
      "iast": "śīghram tau rūpasampannau anujñātau maharṣiṇā |\nprasthitau dhṛta cāpā asī sītayā saha rāghavau",
      "translation": "Those two Raghava-s, the handsome princes, have swiftly set out when permitted by that august sage, wielding bows and swords, and along with Seetha.",
